OL,3,GNEWSAUK charity faces 'reality' of
OL,4,Arestoring education in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Once the cameras leave, we're going to
OL,7,Fface the reality of how to restore
OL,8,Feducation."
OL,10,FJimmy Lama, a Kathmandu-based charity
OL,11,Fworker who has been employed by
OL,12,FSomerset charity School in a Bag since
OL,13,F2012, has seen first-hand the
OL,14,Fdevastation wrought by the immense
OL,15,Fflood along the Trishuli River, on the
OL,16,FNepal-Tibet border, on 26 August.
OL,18,FIt has, to date, left more than 1,000
OL,19,Fpeople known to have died and nearly
OL,20,F4,000 missing.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
