OL,3,GNEWSAUK charity faces 'reality' of
OL,4,Arestoring education in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FEntire villages have been wiped from
OL,7,Fthe map under a torrent of mud and
OL,8,Fwater. Among them, Lama said, are up to
OL,9,F20 schools educating thousands of
OL,10,Fchildren.
